{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0183_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4b7365682aceef8b8fc02e7e185295b817e98983e77ca3e264e2999e0790e722", "ja": "（環、育、桃子。3人ユニットの、劇場お披露目公演が\n終わった。後は、みんなを家まで送るだけだ）", "zh": "（环、育和桃子组成的3人组合，剧场首次亮相公演已经结束了。接下来只要把大家送回家就行了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0183_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "102554a41bc4f79b88ba15f5b18f038d983b1db4ecd78ec944a6bc1ae7e5cb8d", "ja": "おやぶ～ん！", "zh": "老大～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0183_1002_p", "source_sha256": "cbe64a52b7eb3f799c24fa10eff03d216955b843fe1ed254010660ea40464ce9", "ja": "環、お疲れさま！\nあれ、まだ着替えてないのか？", "zh": "环，辛苦了！\n咦，还没换衣服吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0183_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "e2039dffba4d97b6a58d6f71e15c8ba47f7701b5f273860ab0243dc8d3c462c9", "ja": "うん！　あのね、着替えようと思ったんだけど、\nその前にたまき、おやぶんにお願いがあって……。", "zh": "嗯！那个……本来想换衣服的，可是在那之前，环有件事想拜托大叔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0183_1004_040tam", "source_sha256": "8175f98b4ce131c4b0cf86a3cb7ddc4b340242a91d47155dd9f084cc9145e4e2", "ja": "本当はライブの時にお願いすればよかったんだけど、\nたまき、忘れちゃってたんだ。だから……。", "zh": "其实本来应该在演唱会的时候拜托你的，可是环给忘了。所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0183_1005_p", "source_sha256": "de45084e4f5c13026123031e336ad8e25343ecec0037e58023b9d847e6962b98", "ja": "お願い？", "zh": "请求？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0183_1006_040tam", "source_sha256": "6b31cc03791fe727108843b89fe7c94fd1eb50fad910a9ca7b371a2654e2847a", "ja": "えっとね、おやぶん、たまきの写真撮ってくれる？\nたまき、ばあちゃんに写真を送りたいんだ。", "zh": "那个，老大，你能帮环拍张照片吗？\n环想把照片寄给奶奶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0183_1007_p", "source_sha256": "f2c2b477ea24ae7b3f66913b08f7dfd248459b2c8e4327418dd56b2ea08154d7", "ja": "おばあさんに……なるほど、そうか。\nいいぞ、お安い御用だ！", "zh": "给奶奶……原来是这样啊。\n没问题，小事一桩！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0183_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "88153b10610b8abdd38111ede96d4d1302862179ca600016104166bd590b2d68", "ja": "わーい、やったー！　ありがとう、おやぶん！", "zh": "哇—，太好啦—！谢谢老大！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0183_1009_p", "source_sha256": "99ea76aeaafbd695ea9ad78f1399e86c7f29b7618b67d3ff81ba4a8fd44bf2c2", "ja": "けど、ライブが終わった後の写真でいいのか？\nもうちょっと待てば、取材の写真ももらえるけど……。", "zh": "不过，要用演出结束后的照片吗？\n再稍微等一等的话，也能拿到采访的照片……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0183_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "de46b9a4f4281b8c40ef7e93be8fe14efd7da5f973be3d1402fd9c651cc99982", "ja": "そういうのは、スマホからいつでも見られるって\nももこと育が言ってた！", "zh": "那种照片用手机随时都能看！桃子和育是这么说的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0183_1011_040tam", "source_sha256": "02cbc492863ed7ed188e4c977843b76429a2c6bce10696096e7eea07d96ca0dc", "ja": "だから、バックステージっぽい写真を、\nおやぶんに撮ってもらいなさい、だって！", "zh": "所以她们说，让老大给我拍一张像后台那样的照片！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0183_1012_p", "source_sha256": "5c0f41cda5e1747f6526a6c5b4a748b19806e72cd94dc2095a86d17a5f9b8251", "ja": "そうか……じゃあ、まずは1枚な！\n環、1＋1は？", "zh": "这样啊……那就先拍1张吧！\n环，1＋1等于多少？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0183_1013_040tam", "source_sha256": "60e8efe64918bfed7769587edd0c231d89ae8a9833bdd1cebf802f56151395bd", "ja": "にー！", "zh": "二！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0183_1014_se", "source_sha256": "9a3e9215594bd0e1c3c47c2a673ca2e84b32a01ec364a487c8bb2abf1de6e1fd", "ja": "パシャッ", "zh": "咔嚓", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0183_1015_p", "source_sha256": "19688a24c43d30debe6621fce7e8a2ab05e99aa395ee5f15788ab29bab070dac", "ja": "うん、いい笑顔だ！　よし、もう1枚いくぞ。\n今度はポーズを変えて……。", "zh": "嗯，笑容很棒！好，再拍1张。\n这次换个姿势……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0183_1016_040tam", "source_sha256": "3f4e7ba1c0212b585563843b5b1b7143bcbf3eabde1c3801d53573f453d7bd25", "ja": "う～ん……。", "zh": "嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0183_1017_p", "source_sha256": "87ab069501eb451c20b3638459ebe9a16157eba349cce1b96b7b53b79ee0e71f", "ja": "環？　どうかしたのか？", "zh": "环？怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0183_1018_040tam", "source_sha256": "d4e694ddc79935f9a1a2b2d66059c2f7ccfc32848974c71d11e0b15ce6b8c4dc", "ja": "おやぶん……やっぱり写真、\n育とももこもいっしょに撮っていい？", "zh": "老大……果然还是和小育、桃子一起拍照，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0183_1019_040tam", "source_sha256": "60ba55ec486a1419b603b505cdbfbeaf02dc2829e2f2fef06fbe065509af140c", "ja": "たまきひとりだけだと、なんだかさみしいぞ……。", "zh": "只有环一个人的话，总觉得有点寂寞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0183_1020_p", "source_sha256": "3c7a40cb3f7e8bc8bcd509eb46ae6b196841f0eaf4c13ddfb0b37f80a0d7f484", "ja": "はは、そうだな。\n育と桃子は、控え室にいるんだっけ？", "zh": "哈哈，是啊。\n育和桃子在休息室，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0183_1021_040tam", "source_sha256": "a298119caf29295442dd242447dbad2347ba952a7e5b48e8b2632bb54999db4b", "ja": "うん！　たまき、呼んでくる！", "zh": "嗯！环这就去叫她们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0183_1022_p", "source_sha256": "3d657008b1c615813c8d171b238a53cf026b2663b714e46dada655285b253890", "ja": "なら、一緒に行くよ。その方がバックステージらしいし\n……環のおばあさんに、たくさん見せてあげよう！", "zh": "那我就一起去吧。这样才更像后台嘛……\n让环的奶奶好好看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0183_1023_040tam", "source_sha256": "4c2eb1f2591699270aed79b0b3901af5ddd8a46f47949624eb635789fcc3324d", "ja": "わかった！\n行こう、おやぶん！", "zh": "知道了！\n我们走吧，老大！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0183_1024_040tam", "source_sha256": "1fa4020c19d42348b7845a6edd84f8afdd57e8f2de05b9dbea83dd43e8263b32", "ja": "写真見たら、ばあちゃん、ビックリするかな～？\n楽しみだぞ～、くふふ♪", "zh": "奶奶看到照片后，会不会大吃一惊呢～？\n真期待呀～，嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
